en:
Duo: (And that's the Tallgeese...
The mobile suit that served as the prototype
for our Gundams...)

Akira: (Wh-What is this feeling...?
It feels like power is flowing backward...
from Raideen...)

$n: (Tch... So this is what that premonition was!?
If only I hadn't so readily requested maintenance
for the Type 2...)

Todd: Hey Burn, that's a special forces battleship
from the surface. If you're too distracted by Sho,
they'll take you out!

Quattro: Don't wander away from the defense line;
concentrate on defense. There's no telling where enemy
reinforcements will appear!
